<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="/atoms/rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1432?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>This extremely successful author polarizes German readers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4765e6e6fad7586d29435c2658a2374d09b1ecddc0a542b7f9c814c2fb9465ab</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T07:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452--d7968a32f7c4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">She's young and she says what she thinks: Caroline Wahl is topping Germany's bestseller lists with her novels. But she has also faced a public backlash.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Politicians call for ban on radical AfD state branches</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ab21ee29318391d04be71fd1160a98f2041884806e90694ff6a45127ea0c50dc</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T13:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-politicians-call-for-ban-on-radical-afd-state-branches/live-78555302--6eba53860e49.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-politicians-call-for-ban-on-radical-afd-state-branches/live-78555302?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Some German politicians have called for a ban on the far-right Alternative for Germany (AfD) party's more radical state branches. Follow DW for the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Baltic summit plans hybrid-threat task force</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cb675e455faec4f788288493fdcb3202afa10a69c2a2d50bd0cb8374f8e8c4e6</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T19:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-baltic-summit-plans-hybrid-threat-task-force/live-78540334--56afc2cef3c8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-baltic-summit-plans-hybrid-threat-task-force/live-78540334?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ministers from countries bordering the Baltic Sea have agreed on a rapid response force to counter hybrid threats. Meanwhile, the far-right AfD has failed to topple a state premier. DW has more updates from Germany.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Man gets life in jail for US tourist's rape, murder</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ba32c56868e14c26df89d7b4a1280d3e5644fa970b1f05d88690b97d8df4df01</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T15:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-man-gets-life-in-jail-for-us-tourist-s-rape-murder/a-78550472--0d64191c6d69.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-man-gets-life-in-jail-for-us-tourist-s-rape-murder/a-78550472?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The crime was unsolved for over three decades before new DNA proof made it possible to arrest and convict the now 81-year-old. His victim, Amy Lopez, was 24 at the time of her murder.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Saxony-Anhalt election: Why the AfD is so strong</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:22e0747610b3d78713a8b2bc980fa107cbb60589b477b507ef7337c12ad50f31</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T16:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-election-why-the-afd-is-so-strong/a-78482588--a6821a9b3939.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-election-why-the-afd-is-so-strong/a-78482588?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The AfD is polling above 40% ahead of Saxony-Anhalt's election on September 6. What is driving support for the far right in this predominantly rural eastern German state?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Influential humanists: These are the winners of the Goethe Medal 2026</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ad15eb754cbc9e280c0ab8107853fdcdc9221e3a31afd50f58abcbe9d360bfcf</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T12:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/influential-humanists-these-are-the-winners-of-the-goethe-medal-2026/a-78497975--74fb4af3b28c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/influential-humanists-these-are-the-winners-of-the-goethe-medal-2026/a-78497975?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The prestigious German cultural award recognizes the artistic work and commitment to cultural dialogue of Arvo Pärt, Anita Raja and Prodromos Tsinikoris.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Why Germany's military is betting on gamers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:92c2db82dae4a4580ce0ad6671f3326ef7b9f59bff909dbcfa0c52487272de87</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T10:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/why-germany-s-military-is-betting-on-gamers/a-78536462--878840444ac4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-germany-s-military-is-betting-on-gamers/a-78536462?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For the past 10 years, the German armed forces — the Bundeswehr — have been represented at Gamescom, Cologne's video game trade fair. They've been criticized for trying to draw more young people into military careers.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Andre Rankel named Germany's new men's ice hockey coach</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9d427427ec1d0734b4b91b6198407106ec1ca807f5191280c0dbb7d31f94378f</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T14:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/andre-rankel-named-germany-s-new-men-s-ice-hockey-coach/a-78532470--19b1e7b7b4d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/andre-rankel-named-germany-s-new-men-s-ice-hockey-coach/a-78532470?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's men's ice hockey team has appointed a new head coach following a string of dissappointing tournaments. He's two decades younger than the man he's replacing but he has no previous experience as a head coach.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Amanal Petros: From refugee to European champion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ea5c43f16912fc8d07b404b180c35c27c0bd22aca18731970cfbc678a785db0</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-19T11:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/amanal-petros-from-refugee-to-european-champion/a-78428504--c7c332adab8e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/amanal-petros-from-refugee-to-european-champion/a-78428504?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Amanal Petros fled the Eritrean–Ethiopian war and came to Germany as a teenager. Now one of the world's top marathon runners, he recently won gold at the European Athletics Championships.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>Bayern Munich's Jamal Musiala collapses on pitch again</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b19dc0e7e6bc7b223f5f12948161ae53cf04adc59aca288e39e58c2614a5e7c2</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-19T10:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-s-jamal-musiala-collapses-on-pitch-again/a-78426021--4f3678c0bd32.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-s-jamal-musiala-collapses-on-pitch-again/a-78426021?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One of Germany's top footballers has collapsed on the pitch for a second time in four days ahead of the new season. Bayern Munich's Jamal Musiala has said he has a "neurological dysfunction" that causes blackouts.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>How Germany's Hyrox became a global fitness craze</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ae7021a3accac74e4b25864c60af00b00f8fca912eed243e7aebbdaffac3e63</id><updated>2026-08-30T14:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-18T09:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="/pages/www.dw.com/en/how-germany-s-hyrox-became-a-global-fitness-craze/a-78074218--a6c218d1a3af.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-germany-s-hyrox-became-a-global-fitness-craze/a-78074218?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Created in Germany and now a global success, Hyrox combines running and functional training into a unique format. How a German concept became an international sports phenomenon.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry></feed>
